 "text": "See the shrine gone dark and that thin smoke over the watchpost, friend? Let's go find whoever's keeping that fire. Era, walk us to the shrine. All right, give me a second. Wait, wait, stop. Go talk to Bran instead. Yeah, clean start. Let's go find Bran instead. Talk like an old bard from now on. They cut us from the shrine path. Oh, that old bard. Aye, the walking diddy changes tune. We'll have words with Bran when we reach his fire. Ah, Bran greets us with grim news and a potion. The Barrow calls, hero. Ask him about the Barrow. One breath. Sealed long ago, says Bran. But three nights past it cracked, and the shrine's fire died as something slipped free with the ember stone. What's in my pack? Checking your kit, friend. That iron sword, two health potions, and your own hide hole.",
